WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:06.135
"We can't let Meltron get away!" Roxy said.

2
00:00:06.136 --> 00:00:10.221
The damaged robot was flying away from Groon.

3
00:00:10.222 --> 00:00:19.242
"We'll use my energy blaster," Dr. Odd said. "Follow me."

4
00:00:19.243 --> 00:00:25.020
He led the group to a control center in another room.

5
00:00:25.021 --> 00:00:29.308
He pressed some buttons and flipped a switch.

6
00:00:29.309 --> 00:00:33.535
Nothing happened.

7
00:00:33.536 --> 00:00:38.408
"Your energy blaster doesn't seem to be working!" Cozlin said.

8
00:00:38.409 --> 00:00:41.401
"Is it broken?" Roxy asked.

9
00:00:41.402 --> 00:00:46.697
"Give it a minute," Dr. Odd said.

10
00:00:46.698 --> 00:00:49.243
Roxy felt the moon begin to shake slightly.

11
00:00:49.244 --> 00:00:51.478
Then . . . Whoomp!

12
00:00:51.479 --> 00:00:57.427
A shimmering form moved quickly from the moon toward Meltron.

13
00:00:57.428 --> 00:01:05.963
Suddenly Meltron vanished!

14
00:01:05.964 --> 00:01:09.228
"The demon got away!" Wukong said.

15
00:01:09.229 --> 00:01:15.035
Cozlin rolled her eyes. "He's not a demon, Wukong."

16
00:01:15.036 --> 00:01:21.566
Dr. Odd chuckled. "He didn't get away.

17
00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:25.062
The energy blast turned him into a cloud of atoms.

18
00:01:25.063 --> 00:01:31.570
He doesn't exist anymore."

19
00:01:31.571 --> 00:01:38.265
"Whoa," Cozlin said. "My planet doesn't have anything like that!"

20
00:01:38.266 --> 00:01:41.766
"Boring, you," Bippo said.

21
00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:46.211
Roxy frowned. "Not nice, Bippo."

22
00:01:46.212 --> 00:01:50.997
"Sorry, me."

23
00:01:50.998 --> 00:01:54.085
"I should go home," Wukong said.

24
00:01:54.086 --> 00:01:57.127
"I need to destroy the Demon of Mighty Roots.

25
00:01:57.128 --> 00:02:02.957
And the Tang Monk still has a long way to go on his journey.

26
00:02:02.958 --> 00:02:10.582
But this has been fun! If you ever need me to save your galaxy again, come and get me!"

27
00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:17.443
Roxy smiled. "We will, Wukong. Good luck!"

28
00:02:17.444 --> 00:02:19.752
Cozlin opened the portal.

29
00:02:19.753 --> 00:02:24.979
Everyone saw the tree demon lying motionless on the ground.

30
00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:30.740
Wukong jumped through and swung his iron bar as the portal swirled shut.

31
00:02:30.741 --> 00:02:34.256
"I have to go home too," Cozlin said.

32
00:02:34.257 --> 00:02:38.129
"I need to help clean up the mess that the robots made.

33
00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:42.719
We'll need to rebuild a lot of things too."

34
00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:48.712
"Take the spaceship," Dr. Odd said. "I have a few others."

35
00:02:48.713 --> 00:02:53.620
"Thank you," Cozlin said.

36
00:02:53.621 --> 00:02:59.850
Roxy, Terrell, and Dr. Odd watched Cozlin zoom away.

37
00:02:59.851 --> 00:03:04.255
Then Dr. Odd programmed a route back to Earth.

38
00:03:04.256 --> 00:03:11.559
"Even with my advanced hyper-speed, the trip will take about a day," he said.

39
00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:16.705
He showed Roxy and Terrell to a pair of guest rooms.

40
00:03:16.706 --> 00:03:22.131
Everyone went to sleep.

41
00:03:22.132 --> 00:03:30.238
The next morning, as they ate breakfast, Roxy saw Earth in the distance.

42
00:03:30.239 --> 00:03:38.765
Dr. Odd flew them down to Metro City in a spaceship.

43
00:03:38.766 --> 00:03:42.122
"What will you do now?" Terrell asked him.

44
00:03:42.123 --> 00:03:46.607
"The Groonians are out there somewhere," Dr. Odd said.

45
00:03:46.608 --> 00:03:53.058
"I'll find them and tell them they can safely return home now."

46
00:03:53.059 --> 00:03:57.244
"Okay, Dr. Odd." Roxy smiled.

47
00:03:57.245 --> 00:04:02.813
"But remember—you're a member of the Galaxy Squad. If there's big trouble . . ."

48
00:04:02.814 --> 00:04:08.475
"I'll come right back!" Dr. Odd said with a laugh.

49
00:04:08.476 --> 00:04:11.986
"Superhero, him," Bippo said.

50
00:04:11.987 --> 00:04:16.257
Everyone laughed.

51
00:04:16.258 --> 00:04:26.487
"Come on, Bippo," Dr. Odd said. "We have an important mission!"

52
00:04:26.488 --> 00:04:31.538
Bippo followed Dr. Odd into the spaceship.

53
00:04:31.539 --> 00:04:37.667
Roxy and Terrell waved and then watched it blast off.

54
00:04:37.668 --> 00:04:40.440
"Well, Terrell," Roxy said.

55
00:04:40.441 --> 00:04:45.737
"I was wrong about people. I now know that they can change."

56
00:04:45.738 --> 00:04:52.534
"Good," Terrell said. "So you'll stop being mad at the kid who made fun of my glasses?"

57
00:04:52.535 --> 00:05:01.422
Roxy nodded. "But if he ever makes fun of you again, he'll have Rocket Girl to deal with!"

58
00:05:01.423 --> 00:05:06.170
"Actually . . ." Terrell grinned as they started walking toward home.

59
00:05:06.171 --> 00:05:27.898
"If he does it again, he'll have something else to deal with—the Galaxy Squad!"

